  "headline": "FDA records show the plant on our olanzapine label received OAI classifications in 2017 and 2021, and three Class II/III recalls for olanzapine since 2022",
  "headline_cites": ["E7", "E8", "E11", "E12", "E13"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The olanzapine product on our formulary (NDC 33342008411) lists Macleods Pharmaceuticals Limited (FEI 3007517881) as the manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1032020 ended 2017-11-24 and was classified OAI with nine observations including absent written procedures and inadequate laboratory controls.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1157334 ended 2021-11-01 and was also classified OAI.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The most recent inspection 1220834 ended 2023-10-20 and returned to VAI classification.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Since 2022, three recalls have been initiated for Macleods olanzapine tablets: a Class II recall in 2022 for cGMP deviations, a Class II recall in 2024 for failed impurity specifications, and a Class III recall in 2026 for organic and unspecified impurities above specification.",
      "cites": ["E11", "E12", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory across our three sites ranges from 12 to 29 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    }
  ]
}
